# Falling Cow - Pseudocode
Set initial conditions: v_x, v_y, x_0, y_0, mass, drag, time_step
Function calc_force(position, velocity, mass, drag):
    gravity contributes (0, -mass * g)
    drag contributes -drag * |v| * v
    return total force
Function update_velocity(v, force, mass, dt):
    a = force/mass
    return v + a * dt
Function update_position(x, v, dt):
    return x + v * dt
Function calc_energy(position, velocity, mass):
    KE = 0.5 * mass * |v|^2
    PE = mass * g * y
    return KE, PE, KE + PE
Main:
    Set initial conditions
    While y > 0:
        Record time, position, velocity, energies
        force = calc_force(...)
        velocity = update_velocity(...)
        position = update_position(...)
        t = t + dt
    Save trajectory to file
    Plot trajectory and energies
    Compare to analytic solution
